**[r1, F2 — notation, defined here at first use.]** The b₀-SPLIT, used by the
S4.1 branch table and by S4.2 and imported from wave-18 S1
(ITERLAWLIFT_CORNER_2026-08-08.md S1, a source of record above; it was used
